":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m019-0414","start":414,"end":416,"surface":"吳人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-066","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p020","text":"吳王既誅伍子胥，遂伐齊。齊鮑氏殺其君悼公而立陽生。吳王欲討其賊，不勝而去。其後二年，吳王召魯衛之君會之橐皋。其明年，因北大會諸侯於黃池，以令周室。越王句踐襲殺吳太子，破吳兵。吳王聞之，乃歸，使使厚幣與越平。後九年，越王句踐遂滅吳，殺王夫差；而誅太宰嚭，以不忠於其君，而外受重賂，與己比周也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"齊鮑氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003848","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"陽生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0045","start":45,"end":49,"surface":"魯衛之君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id